{%- comment -%}
  04 — MECHANISM OF THE PROBLEM
  Belief installed: "You're not getting hunted. You're volunteering."
  Uses their language (stop-hunting, exit liquidity) tied to a REAL mechanism
  — orders resting where stops cluster — not a conspiracy.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="ascend-section mech-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="mech-{{ section.id }}-h">
  <div class="ascend-wrap">
    {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="ascend-eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <h2 id="mech-{{ section.id }}-h" class="mech-{{ section.id }}__h">{{ s.heading }}</h2>

    {%- if s.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="mech-{{ section.id }}__intro">{{ s.intro }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <ol class="mech-{{ section.id }}__steps">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <li class="mech-{{ section.id }}__step" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <span class="mech-{{ section.id }}__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ forloop.index }}</span>
            <div class="mech-{{ section.id }}__stepbody">
              <h3 class="mech-{{ section.id }}__steph">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>
              <p class="mech-{{ section.id }}__stept">{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.punch != blank -%}
      <p class="mech-{{ section.id }}__punch">{{ s.punch }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.disclaimer != blank -%}
      <p class="mech-{{ section.id }}__disc">{{ s.disclaimer }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{%- style -%}
  .mech-{{ section.id }} {
    background: var(--ascend-bg-2, #101319);
    color: var(--ascend-body, #C4CAD3);
    padding-block: var(--ascend-pad-block, 5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.09));
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__h {
    font-family: var(--ascend-sans);
    color: var(--ascend-ink, #EDF0F3);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 5vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__h em { font-style: normal; color: var(--ascend-loss, #C85248); }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__intro { font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 54ch; }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__intro p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__steps {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: none;
    margin: 2.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.35rem;
    background: var(--ascend-surface, #161A20);
    border: 1px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.09));
    border-radius: var(--ascend-radius, 12px);
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.14));
    color: var(--ascend-muted, #8C94A0);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    flex: none;
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__steph {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--ascend-ink, #EDF0F3);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__stept { margin: 0; color: var(--ascend-body, #C4CAD3); line-height: 1.55; }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__punch {
    margin: 2.4rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--ascend-serif, Georgia, serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ascend-ink, #EDF0F3);
    max-width: 24ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__punch strong { color: var(--ascend-loss, #C85248); font-weight: 650; }
  .mech-{{ section.id }}__disc {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ascend-muted, #8C94A0);
    max-width: 56ch;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.14));
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "04 Problem Mechanism",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ascend-shell",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Where the money actually goes" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "<p>You're not getting hunted. You're <em>volunteering</em>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro",
      "default": "<p>Everyone's stops sit in the same obvious places — under the swing low, above the range high, on the round number. That's not paranoia; it's just where a rule-of-thumb tells everyone to put them. A cluster of resting stop orders is, mechanically, a pool of liquidity: a place where size can get filled at once.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "punch",
      "label": "Punch line",
      "default": "<p>An entry with no filter tends to land in exactly the same spot as everyone else's — <strong>right on the liquidity, just before it gets taken.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "disclaimer",
      "label": "Honest-framing note",
      "default": "<p>No one is watching your specific stop. It's simpler and worse than that: price is drawn to where orders rest, and unfiltered entries keep putting you on the wrong side of that draw — over and over, by design of your own habit.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Mechanism step",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Step title", "default": "Everyone's stop goes to the same place" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "text", "label": "Step text", "default": "<p>Under the low, over the high. Predictable by construction.</p>" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "04 Problem Mechanism",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "step", "settings": { "title": "Stops cluster in the obvious spots", "text": "<p>Under the swing low, over the range high, on the round number — because that's what every guide taught.</p>" } },
        { "type": "step", "settings": { "title": "A cluster of stops is a pool of liquidity", "text": "<p>Resting orders are fuel. To fill size, price has to trade into where those orders sit.</p>" } },
        { "type": "step", "settings": { "title": "You enter without a filter", "text": "<p>You chase the move into the level — the same level everyone's stop is leaning on.</p>" } },
        { "type": "step", "settings": { "title": "Price sweeps, then reverses", "text": "<p>The pool gets taken, your stop is part of it, and the real move happens without you.</p>" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
